  "solution": {
    "text": "Let numbers be $a, b \\Rightarrow a+b=18, \\sqrt{a b}=4 \\quad \\Rightarrow a b=16, a$ and $b$ are roots of the equation\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad x^2-18 x+16=0$"
  }
